.github/
# NOTE: aiter csrc/{ck_gemm*,ck_batched*,py_itfs_cu,hsa} must NOT be excluded when
# building aiter from source (Dockerfile.rocm72). py_itfs_cu holds asm_mha_fwd.cu /
# asm_mha_bwd.cu which DEFINE fmha_v3_fwd/bwd; excluding them yields a JIT .so with
# an undefined `aiter::torch_itfs::fmha_v3_fwd` symbol. Total ~1.5MB, safe to keep.
third_party/aiter/aiter/jit/build/
third_party/aiter/op_tests/
third_party/aiter/benchmarks/
third_party/aiter/docker/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache/
.claude/
*.log
